{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/Trackastrophe_Capsule_Description.png?t=1743166616\" /><strong>Trackastrophe! </strong>is a wacky puzzle game about an eccentric old train travelling a colorful world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyse the maps, make a path by placing a variety of different track tiles, then pray your train gets to the end in one piece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/description_title_01.png?t=1743166616\" />The game features over<strong> 100+ levels</strong> which will make you travel through different locations, each including their own unique <strong>themes</strong> and <strong>mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/tileposing.gif?t=1743166616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/description_title_02.png?t=1743166616\" />For those who seek a bigger challenge, the game features several <strong>bonus</strong> levels that will be sure to make you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/Crash.gif?t=1743166616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/description_title_03.png?t=1743166616\" />From <strong>tunnels</strong> to <strong>portals</strong> to very slippery <strong>ice</strong>, each world contains new mechanics for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/boucle.gif?t=17431